OL,3,GNEWSABelfast duo go from 'fish out of
OL,4,Awater' to a Big Deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo friends from west Belfast, who
OL,7,Fdescribed themselves as "fish out of
OL,8,Fwater" when it comes to the world of
OL,9,Fart, have been crowned winners of the
OL,10,FBBC's The Big Deal with Steph McGovern
OL,12,FAfter winning Wednesday's final, Gavin
OL,13,Fand Liam took home the top prize of
OL,14,F#50,000 worth of art.
OL,16,FThe show sees budding entrepreneurs
OL,17,Fbattle it out in the world of art
OL,18,Fdealing, taking on weekly tasks to test
OL,19,Ftheir skills, negotiate deals and, most
OL,20,Fimportantly, sell art.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
